{"entries":[[3709,"injuste","adjective",4,"/ɛ̃.ʒyst/","","",[["unjust; unfair","",[],[],[["Il a pensé que c'était injuste qu'on soit plus souvent touché par ce qui arrive aux beaux qu'aux laids.","",""]]]],{"masculine":"injuste","masculine_plural":"injustes"},[],""],[4859,"injure","noun",4,"/ɛ̃.ʒyʁ/","f",[4113,"Fr-injure.ogg.mp3"],[["offense, insult","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"injures"},[],["Louer les princes des vertus qu'ils n'ont pas, c'est leur dire impunément des injures.","Il cracha une injure, s'élança et réempoigna la jeune femme qui, cette fois, se débattit en vain.","Et elle me bombarde, d'une voix mauvaise, avec un accent crapuleux, d'une bordée d'injures grasses."]],[5017,"injustice","noun",4,"/ɛ̃.ʒys.tis/","f",[4241,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-injustice.wav.mp3"],[["injustice","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"injustices"},[],["Son procédé est plein d'injustice.","Comme mon guide me conduit à la buanderie commune, une rougeaude aux manches retroussées l'interpelle, élève la voix, dénonce des injustices.","Il venait de songer, comme à un aspect spécial de l'injustice irrationnelle du destin, que ces deux hommes vivaient, alors que Kurt était mort."]],[7439,"injection","noun",3,"/ɛ̃.ʒɛk.sjɔ̃/","f",[6272,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-injection.wav.mp3"],[["injection","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"injections"},[],["Embaumement par injection.","Injection d'un signal vidéo.","En plasturgie : moulage par injection de plastique."]],[7650,"injecter","verb",3,"/ɛ̃.ʒɛk.te/","",[6440,"Fr-injecter.ogg.mp3"],[["to inject","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"injecter","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"injectant","past_participle":"injecté","present":["injecte","injectes","injecte","injectons","injectez","injectent"],"imperfect":["injectais","injectais","injectait","injections","injectiez","injectaient"],"future":["injecterai","injecteras","injectera","injecterons","injecterez","injecteront"],"conditional":["injecterais","injecterais","injecterait","injecterions","injecteriez","injecteraient"],"subjunctive":["injecte","injectes","injecte","injections","injectiez","injectent"]},[],["Injecter un cadavre.","Injecter les veines, les artères."]],[8408,"injurier","verb",3,"/ɛ̃.ʒy.ʁje/","",[7058,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Arthur_Crbz-injurier.wav.mp3"],[["to abuse, howl abuse at","",[],[],[]]],{"infinitive":"injurier","auxiliary":"avoir","present_participle":"injuriant","past_participle":"injurié","present":["injurie","injuries","injurie","injurions","injuriez","injurient"],"imperfect":["injuriais","injuriais","injuriait","injuriions","injuriiez","injuriaient"],"future":["injurierai","injurieras","injuriera","injurierons","injurierez","injurieront"],"conditional":["injurierais","injurierais","injurierait","injurierions","injurieriez","injurieraient"],"subjunctive":["injurie","injuries","injurie","injuriions","injuriiez","injurient"]},[],["Dans la situation budgétaire actuelle, le défi auquel sont confrontés les pouvoirs publics est de réduire les dépenses sans injurier l'avenir.","On s'injuriait à table. On injuriait même le supérieur, homme emporté mais faible. On lui rappelait à l'occasion que son père avait été pendu.","Pyrrhon aimait que l'orateur Démosthène injuriât si bien Philippe ; il n'eût pas détesté que Philippe injuriât aussi bien l'orateur Démosthène."]],[10238,"injonction","noun",3,"/ɛ̃.ʒɔ̃k.sjɔ̃/","f",[8538,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-injonction.wav.mp3"],[["injunction (the act of enjoining)","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"injonctions"},[],["Et malgré l'injonction péremptoire de Socrate, il est impossible de se connaître soi-même."]],[12787,"injustement","adverb",2,"/ɛ̃.ʒys.tə.mɑ̃/","",[10454,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-injustement.wav.mp3"],[["unfairly; unjustly","",[],[],[]]],{},[],""],[14981,"injustifié","adjective",2,"/ɛ̃.ʒys.ti.fje/","","",[["unjustified, unwarranted","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injustifié","feminine":"injustifiée","masculine_plural":"injustifiés","feminine_plural":"injustifiées"},[],""],[20084,"injoignable","adjective",2,"/ɛ̃.ʒwa.ɲabl/","",[16103,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-injoignable.wav.mp3"],[["unreachable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injoignable","masculine_plural":"injoignables"},[],["Très cher et injoignable ami,","À cette époque, je regrettais que le peu de raison dont je disposais me rendît presque injoignable cette élite des « amis du peuple »."]],[20109,"injurieux","adjective",2,"/ɛ̃.ʒy.ʁjø/","",[16122,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-injurieux.wav.mp3"],[["injurious, hurtful, insulting, offensive","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injurieux","feminine":"injurieuse","masculine_plural":"injurieux","feminine_plural":"injurieuses"},[],["Les apostrophes injurieuses, les interpellations violentes des réactionnaires, interrompirent cent fois les discours des orateurs des gauches.","Mes prophètes sont très savants, et j'ai trois Dieux Très puissants, pour garder mon royaume et ma ville Et ployer sous le joug mon peuple injurieux."]],[21598,"injustifiable","adjective",2,"","","",[["unjustifiable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injustifiable","masculine_plural":"injustifiables"},[],""],[23906,"injecté","adjective",1,"/ɛ̃.ʒɛk.te/","",[19296,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-inject%C3%A9.wav.mp3"],[["bloodshot (eyes)","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injecté","feminine":"injectée","masculine_plural":"injectés","feminine_plural":"injectées"},[],""],[24029,"injecteur","noun",1,"/ɛ̃.ʒɛk.tœʁ/","m",[19400,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-LoquaxFR-injecteur.wav.mp3"],[["injector","",[],[],[]]],{"plural":"injecteurs"},[],["Même, un instant, voyant le niveau d'eau baisser, le mécanicien dut faire mouvoir le petit volant de l'injecteur, bien que cela diminuât la pression."]],[34403,"injurieusement","adverb",1,"/ɛ̃.ʒy.ʁjøz.mɑ̃/","",[27749,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-injurieusement.wav.mp3"],[["injuriously","",[],[],[["Pierre a tenté de poser une question à Christine, qui lui a répondu, comme à son habitude, injurieusement.","Pierre tried to ask Christine a question. She, as usual, responded with abuse.",""]]]],{},[],""],[35267,"injectable","adjective",1,"/ɛ̃.ʒɛk.tabl/","",[28397,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-injectable.wav.mp3"],[["injectable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injectable","masculine_plural":"injectables"},[],""],[36172,"injouable","adjective",1,"/ɛ̃.ʒwabl/","",[29092,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Penegal-injouable.wav.mp3"],[["unplayable","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injouable","masculine_plural":"injouables"},[],""],[61781,"injectif","adjective",0,"/ɛ̃.ʒɛk.tif/","",[43224,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-injectif.wav.mp3"],[["injective","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injectif","feminine":"injective","masculine_plural":"injectifs","feminine_plural":"injectives"},[],["Une fonction injective."]],[61782,"injonctif","adjective",0,"/ɛ̃.ʒɔ̃k.tif/","",[43225,"LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-injonctif.wav.mp3"],[["injunctive","",[],[],[]]],{"masculine":"injonctif","feminine":"injonctive","masculine_plural":"injonctifs","feminine_plural":"injonctives"},[],["Le serf est sommé (parole injonctive) de réaliser ce désir et, par conséquent, efface en lui tout désir propre."]],[61783,"injurologie","noun",0,"/ɛ̃.ʒy.ʁɔ.lɔ.ʒi/","f","",[["the study of insults","",["rare","uncountable"],[],[]]],{},[],["Ensuite arrive un florilège de gros mots, d'expressions fort désobligeantes telles qu'on n'en trouverait que dans un lexique d'injurologie bretonne."]]],"redirects":{"injecta":[[7650,34]],"injectables":[[35267,41]],"injectai":[[7650,30]],"injectaient":[[7650,27]],"injectais":[[7650,25]],"injectait":[[7650,28]],"injectant":[[7650,46]],"injectas":[[7650,32]],"injectasse":[[7650,48]],"injectassent":[[7650,51]],"injectasses":[[7650,50]],"injectassiez":[[7650,49]],"injectassions":[[7650,47]],"injecte":[[7650,11]],"injectent":[[7650,36]],"injectera":[[7650,20]],"injecterai":[[7650,16]],"injecteraient":[[7650,3]],"injecterais":[[7650,1]],"injecterait":[[7650,4]],"injecteras":[[7650,18]],"injecterez":[[7650,17]],"injecteriez":[[7650,2]],"injecterions":[[7650,0]],"injecterons":[[